cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Chicago Black Culture — Churches, Clubs, Theaters, Venues, Banks"
version: 1.0
date-released: 2026-11-16
abstract: "199 Black Chicago places — churches (62), clubs (48), venues (45), theaters (32), banks (12) — reconciled from two October 2026 builds (a 183-row graph union file and a 124-row editorial seed; 108 joined on exact normalized name, full merge log published). Grades were base-mapped from a legacy vocabulary (STRONG EVIDENCE → Supported) with source text preserved and the lowest grade taken where builds disagreed; nothing was upgraded. No coordinates are included and no map is claimed. The FAQ layer was generated mechanically from row fields on 2026-11-16 and is labeled as generated."
authors:
  - name: "CultureTechLens NFP"
